{"id": "t135-059", "text": "Joe & Mehmet - engagement drinks back on!! Sat 17th Jan from 8pm, the Prince Albert. Mehmet's dad home from hospital now, doing well. Joe wants it low-key, Mehmet wants a DJ, so who knows. they asked if I'd say a few words. need to write something short & funny by mid Jan. Mehmet's mum is flying in from Ankara the Thurs before", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat 17th Jan from 8pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home from hospital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "write something short & funny", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by mid Jan", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Ankara", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Thurs before", "anchor": "e3"}]}
